# Load the flake's default devShell through nix-direnv, which Home Manager
# provides (programs.direnv.nix-direnv in modules/programs/shell.nix).
#
# Uses the Git-backed flake reference rather than `path:.`: the devShell
# needs no untracked files, and `path:.` would copy ignored state (.jj,
# .direnv, result, nested checkouts) into the store on every reload.

# jj-ci is built from this script via builtins.readFile.
watch_file jj/ci.nu

use flake
